ved_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-12-02T00:21:13Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:36:18Z","closed_at":"2025-12-03T17:49:47Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113418","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113418","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113418.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113418.patch","merged_at":"2025-12-03T17:49:47Z"},"body":"This was visible in tooltips displayed in shortcuts, including in the editor itself.\r\n\r\nFor example, \"Forward (W (Physical))\" is now displayed as \"Forward (W - Physical)\".\r\n\r\nAdditionally, this changes `(unset)` to use lowercase, so that it stands out more compared to other keys. This also better matches what the editor displays when you have no scenes open:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"135\" height=\"38\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1d76bafb-8b82-4d82-8e5e-c9c42b3564d0\" />\r\n<br>\r\n\r\nIdeally, we'd go for live translation according to the user's current keyboard layout, but this has several caveats:\r\n\r\n- Covering every keyboard layout on all platforms is a difficult task. The user may also change their keyboard layout at runtime (although this is uncommon).\r\n- Live translation isn't suitable for every use case, e.g. in the input map editor where we want the Physical/Unicode labels to remain visible. Even if we go with live translation, we'd still need to keep the traditional method in place.\r\n  - It would be safe to apply live translation in shortcut tooltips at least still.\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\n- This closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13301\r\n(the symbols part is tracked in https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3010).\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"506\" height=\"145\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22a12d78-8606-422c-bcbd-fef6bb997f9f\" /> | <img width=\"506\" height=\"145\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3337280e-3fc7-4307-a71a-20a0af0fa651\" />\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113418/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113418/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}